    "id": 4901032150330,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "透ちゃんの部屋の上を通って降りるなら\r\nどの辺りになりそうか、考えやすそうですね……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150330"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150340,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "んー……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150340"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150350,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "屋敷の回りの足跡は２種類だけど\r\nどっちも降りてきた感じじゃなさそう～？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150350"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150360,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "多分、八宮さんと有栖川さんの……？\r\n外、うろついていたって言ってたし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150360"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00575",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150370,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……\r\nね、この辺って",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150370"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150380,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "道具がなくても降りられそうじゃない～？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150380"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0421",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150390,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ぴぇ……！\r\n雨樋とか飾りを辿って……ってこと……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150390"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0422",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150400,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………！\r\nあ、あれ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150400"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00465",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "se": "0881",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150410,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\n踏み荒らされた跡発見～！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150410"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0132",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150420,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "んー……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150420"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150430,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "ここ、いい感じに降りられそうじゃない？\r\nちょうど部屋の上らへんだし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150430"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00575",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150440,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "き、昨日はぬかるんでたから……\r\n足跡、少ししか残ってないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150440"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150450,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、歩き去るものだけで\r\nここに来た跡はないみたいです……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150450"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150460,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "なので──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150460"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "浅倉さんの部屋の上を通った何者かが、\r\nここに降りてきた、って考えるのが妥当ですね……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00087",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "犯人はもしかしたら──",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "天窓から脱出した？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "翼があるのかも？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "外部犯では？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0914",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150470,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わ、わたしもそうかなって……\r\n屋敷の周りに『やってきて消えた』足跡がないので……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "join",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150470"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150480,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "何……？\r\n飛んだってこと？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150480"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150490,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "それって『怪盗２８３』のこと～？\r\nじゃあなんで足跡残ってるの？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150490"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150500,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "天窓から出てここに降りた、のかな……？\r\n屋敷の周りに『やってきて消えた』足跡がないし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "join",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150500"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150510,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "吊り橋が落ちる前にやって来て、\r\nどこかに身を隠していた人がいたって話？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150510"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150520,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150520"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150530,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "入り口もひとつしかないし\r\n結構人も多いのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150530"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150540,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "見つからずに隠れてたならすごいね～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150540"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150550,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "…………\r\nありえないとは言わないけど、考えづらい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150550"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0454",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150560,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "偶然、天窓を開けたままにした、\r\n呼んでもいない人間を迎え入れた……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150560"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150570,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そんな杜撰さで不審者の侵入を許したと？\r\n『Ａ』ともあろう人が",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150570"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "そう、ですね……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150580,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "あ、あの……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150580"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150590,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "て、天窓から出てここに降りた……\r\nってことはない、ですかね……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150590"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150600,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "屋敷の周りに『やってきて消えた』足跡がありませんし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "join",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150600"
  },
  {
    "label": "join",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00575",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150610,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "客室棟の窓から出て、透ちゃんの部屋の上を通って、\r\nここに降りるのも変な気がしますし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150610"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "この足跡は、八宮さんや有栖川さんの足跡からも遠い……\r\nふたりが足跡を偽装した可能性は薄そうですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150620,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "ミステリーだね\r\n天窓から脱出する犯人って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150620"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150630,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～\r\nそうですね～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150630"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00087",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150640,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でも、天窓に上るのって難しそうじゃない？\r\nさっき見たでしょ～？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150640"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150650,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "リモコンで開けてみたけど、\r\n屋根にロープとかもかけられなさそうだったし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150650"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150660,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "それもそうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150660"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150670,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "で、でも、足音がして、\r\n足跡があるのも事実だから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150670"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150680,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "天窓から脱出してない、って\r\n言い切れないんじゃないかな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150680"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150690,
    "speaker": "透",
    "text": "一理あるね、なるほど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150690"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150700,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "もうちょっと足跡\r\n綺麗に残ってたらよかったのにね～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150700"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0328",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150710,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あんまり大きくない\r\nレディースの靴って感じかな～……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150710"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150720,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……弟子のあなたにとっては朗報では？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150720"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032150730,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "この足跡は自分のものではない、と主張できるわけですから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103215/4901032150730"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "……ありがとうございます",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "弟子",
    "text": "それでは、部屋に戻りましょうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]